WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Twelve minutes can be enough to begin a habit.
But can it really replace an hour of meditation?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
One seller advertises that shortcut. To test it,
researchers would need to define what equal benefit means.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Is it a feeling, a brain signal, an attention test,
or improvement over months? These are different outcomes.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Reviews of brainwave-audio studies find mixed evidence.
Research into meditation generally does not prove this recording works.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try twelve minutes with a simple timer first.
Compare the evidence before considering a paid library.
